    ('Mannequins in Fashion Window', 'Look for dressed-up plastic or fabric figures posing in clothing displays, focusing on how they''re positioned and styled.', 'Identify one or more human-like mannequins dressed in clothing displayed within a storefront window. The mannequins must be clearly visible and oriented to showcase apparel.', 'common'::public.item_rarity, 'Modern mannequins are typically made of fiberglass or resin, not plastic, which allows them to withstand repeated dressing without degrading.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/3109e5a3e0521317.jpg', 0),
    ('Neon Store Sign', 'Find glowing tubes of colored light spelling out words or logos on a storefront, especially visible at dusk or night.', 'Locate a neon sign with glowing tubes forming letters or symbols on a store exterior or window. The neon must be illuminated and visible against the background.', 'common'::public.item_rarity, 'Neon signs can last 10-15 years continuously on, longer than most LED alternatives, and glow through electrical excitation of noble gases.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/6b24dba8ebd2cc61.jpg', 1),
    ('Reflected Street Scene in Glass', 'Photograph a storefront window that mirrors the street, buildings, or people behind you to capture dual perspectives in one shot.', 'Capture a storefront window pane reflecting street elements such as buildings, pedestrians, vehicles, or sky. The reflection must be distinctly visible on the glass surface.', 'common'::public.item_rarity, 'Window reflections in photographs are technically mirror images that contain more depth information than the scene behind the glass itself.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/57397d0497c2d59f.jpg', 2),
    ('Product Pyramid Display', 'Look for items stacked in a triangular formation, usually in a window or on a shelf, with the biggest base narrowing to a point.', 'Find products stacked or arranged in a pyramid formation within a store window or on display. Items must be stacked in tiers forming a triangular shape.', 'common'::public.item_rarity, 'Pyramid displays emerged in the 1950s and exploit visual psychology: products arranged at eye level sell 30-40% more than those above or below.', null, 3),
    ('Vintage Shop Window', 'Find an older store with aged items, antiques, or retro goods displayed in the window with worn or nostalgic styling.', 'Show a storefront window displaying antique or vintage merchandise such as furniture, collectibles, or retro items with visible aged appearance.', 'uncommon'::public.item_rarity, 'Vintage storefronts often used curved glass windows because early sheet glass couldn''t be made perfectly flat; the curve was structural.', null, 4),
    ('Illuminated Entrance Archway', 'Photograph the lit doorway or arched entrance to a shop, capturing how the lighting frames the entry.', 'Capture an arched entryway to a store with visible lighting installed. The arch structure and lights must be clearly seen framing the entrance.', 'common'::public.item_rarity, 'Archways in retail architecture increase perceived spaciousness by 23% compared to flat entrances, based on behavioral retail studies.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/642613e61bafe091.jpg', 5),
    ('Seasonal Decoration Arrangement', 'Look for holiday or seasonal-themed decorations clustered in a window display like holiday lights, wreaths, or themed props.', 'Display seasonal decorations in a storefront such as holiday lights, ornaments, wreaths, or themed props arranged for visual appeal.', 'common'::public.item_rarity, 'Seasonal displays change every 6-8 weeks in most retail settings because human attention to static visuals drops 50% after that period.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/8ea4a72ca0c8fbda.jpg', 6),
    ('Storefront Metal Grating', 'Find the metal bars or security gates on a storefront window or door, especially the patterns and shadows they cast.', 'Show metal security grating, grilles, or bars covering a storefront window or door. The metallic grid pattern must be clearly visible.', 'common'::public.item_rarity, 'Metal security gratings became standard in the 1970s and are designed to collapse downward in 4-6 seconds during emergency exits.', null, 7),
    ('Display Mannequin Pose', 'Focus on a single mannequin and how its body is positioned—arms, legs, head tilt—to create an interesting or unusual stance.', 'Capture a mannequin in a distinctive pose within a display. Focus on the posture, arm position, or stance showing dynamic presentation of clothing.', 'common'::public.item_rarity, 'Mannequin poses follow strict ergonomic rules: arms angled 20-30 degrees from body reduces visual tension and increases purchase intent.', null, 8),
    ('Boutique Window Lighting', 'Capture the warm or colorful artificial lights inside a small shop window highlighting the products on display.', 'Show lighting fixtures illuminating a high-end boutique window display. Lights such as spotlights, LEDs, or overhead fixtures must be visible.', 'uncommon'::public.item_rarity, 'Boutique windows typically use 3000K warm lighting because it increases perceived product value by up to 15% compared to cool white light.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/1d2fd4d4ee1dba1e.jpg', 9),
    ('Storefront Door Handle', 'Photograph the door handle or knob detail—metal, ornate, rusty, or decorative—at a shop entrance.', 'Photograph a door handle, knob, or pull mechanism on a retail store entrance. The hardware must be clearly visible and in focus.', 'common'::public.item_rarity, 'Door handle placement psychology: handles at 48 inches high trigger subconscious approach behavior in 89% of passersby.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/88e32a83838af44b.jpg', 10),
    ('Decorative Window Frame', 'Look for the ornamental or architectural framing around a storefront window, whether it''s ornate trim, molding, or modern edges.', 'Display ornamental framing around a storefront window such as molding, trim, or decorative borders. The frame structure must be distinctly visible.', 'uncommon'::public.item_rarity, 'Window frames with trim increased storefront sales by 21% in retail studies because frames psychologically define and prioritize displayed items.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/584ed98a279cc497.jpg', 11),
    ('Product Price Tag Display', 'Find clearly visible price tags or signs on displayed products, showing numbers and sometimes handwritten or promotional details.', 'Show price tags, labels, or placards on products within a storefront window or display. Text and pricing information must be legible or clearly visible.', 'common'::public.item_rarity, 'Price tags placed at eye level on the right side of products increase perceived value more than left placement, due to reading direction habit.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/59632f1f89cb4452.jpg', 12),
    ('Store Window Curtain', 'Photograph the fabric, drapes, or sheer curtains inside a storefront window and how they frame or partially hide the display.', 'Capture window curtains, drapes, or fabric coverings on a storefront. The curtain material and texture must be clearly visible in the frame.', 'uncommon'::public.item_rarity, 'Sheer curtains in storefronts filter light without blocking vision, reducing glare by 40% while maintaining product visibility.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/bcf0ff9848aa7ac0.jpg', 13),
    ('Retail Shelf Arrangement', 'Look inside a store at how products are organized on shelves—neat rows, stacked items, or creative arrangements of merchandise.', 'Photograph products organized on retail shelves within a storefront. Items must be neatly arranged on visible shelf units.', 'common'::public.item_rarity, 'Shelf arrangement follows the ''golden triangle'': items at waist, eye, and hand level account for 60-70% of impulse purchases.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/bffab4fef1681986.jpg', 14),
    ('Commercial Glass Storefront', 'Photograph the large expanse of glass windows and doors that form the front of a retail store, capturing its transparency and reflections.', 'Capture the glass facade of a commercial storefront. Large glass panes forming the storefront structure must be clearly visible.', 'common'::public.item_rarity, 'Modern storefront glass is typically 6-8mm thick tempered glass, designed to shatter into small granules rather than sharp shards for safety.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/733d70e292e64339.jpg', 15),
    ('Window Display Backdrop', 'Find the back wall or background element behind products in a window display—painted, textured, or decorative material.', 'Show the backdrop material or background installed within a store window display. Backdrop must form the rear surface supporting displayed items.', 'uncommon'::public.item_rarity, 'Solid color backdrops increase focus on products by 35%, while patterned backdrops distract the eye but create perceived luxury.', null, 16),
    ('Storefront Sidewalk Sign', 'Look for a sandwich board, A-frame sign, or standing sign placed on the sidewalk in front of a store entrance.', 'Photograph a sign placed on the sidewalk or pavement in front of a store. The sign must stand independently outside the storefront.', 'rare'::public.item_rarity, 'Sidewalk signs capture attention within 2-3 seconds; studies show A-frame signs positioned at 45 degrees achieve 40% higher engagement than vertical.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/e0613f76ebf56405.jpg', 17)
